so101-pi05-base
Copyright 2026 Dongyoon Kim

This repository distributes model weights obtained by fully fine-tuning
Physical Intelligence's pi0.5 vision-language-action model (base checkpoint
lerobot/pi05_base) on SO-101 and SO-100 robot data.

