================================================================================
Training data
================================================================================

The training set was assembled from publicly available SO-101 and SO-100
datasets on the Hugging Face Hub together with recordings made by the author.
The released subset of that data contains only source datasets that declare a
license: 149 from the Hub under apache-2.0, 1 from the Hub under mit, and 6
recorded by the author and released under apache-2.0. Attribution required by
Apache License 2.0 Section 4, and a copy of the Apache License 2.0 itself, are
distributed with the released dataset as ATTRIBUTION.md and LICENSE.

Datasets whose source repository declares no license were not redistributed.
